        <div class="notes" id="notes-32059538" data-guid="32059538"></div>
        <div id="questions-32059538" data-guid="32059538" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="32059538_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any clause, sentence, paragraph, section, word or part of this chapter is adjudged by any court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, the judgment shall not affect, impair or invalidate the remainder of this chapter but shall be confined in its operation to the clause, sentence, paragraph, section, word or part of this chapter directly involved in the controversy in which judgment is rendered.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

            </div>
